{"title":"Winners of the Wildlife Photographer of the Year 2026","link":"https://kottke.org/26/10/winners-of-the-wildlife-photographer-of-the-year-2026","date":1793024940000,"content":"\n         \t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792917530-d0977975.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792917530-d0977975.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792917530-d0977975.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792917606-73045d77.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792917606-73045d77.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792917606-73045d77.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792917806-ccf51c58.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792917806-ccf51c58.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792917806-ccf51c58.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792917748-172f9206.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792917748-172f9206.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792917748-172f9206.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792918117-a29307f0.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792918117-a29307f0.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792918117-a29307f0.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>London’s Natural History Museum has announced the winners of the 2026 Wildlife Photographer of the Year, a competition that has been going since 1965. You can see a gallery of all the winners <a href=\"https://www.nhm.ac.uk/wpy/gallery?tags=award.ctgrywnnr,award.impactaward,award.wldlfphtgrphrfthyr,award.yngwldlfphtgrphrfthyr&amp;tags=ed.current\">on the competition website</a> (and also places like <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/environment/gallery/2026/oct/14/wildlife-photographer-of-the-year-2026-winners-in-pictures\">The Guardian</a> and <a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/photography/2026/10/winners-wildlife-photographer-year-2026/689005?gift=j9r7avb6p-KY8zdjhsiSZ_IDWljBk4RsBy6qXZusibY\">The Atlantic</a>.)</p>\n\t<p>Photos above by Kutub Uddin, Amelie Davis, Michał Michalski, James Lewin, and Alexis Tinker-Tsavalas.\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/best%20of\">best of</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/best%20of%202026\">best of 2026</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"5b483da5a5e64976b286d7cee02e114e135bd0d26deec816efb7504edf513189","category":"Sites"}